        "December 17, 2025"
      ],
      "description": "A horizontally scrollable list of recent news articles with thumbnail images, category tags, titles, and publication dates."
    },
    {
      "id": "footer-links",
      "page": "home",
      "type": "list",
      "source_ref": "## Footer Navigation",
      "expected_content": [
        "Our story",
        "Leadership",
        "Features",
        "Safety tools",
        "Community",
        "Privacy"
